{"id":"3ff9bab1e15a730d","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-universal-coeff.md","title":"Universal Coefficient Theorem","display":"thm-universal-coeff — Universal Coefficient Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-universal-coeff","aliases":["58-thm-universal-coeff"],"display":"thm-universal-coeff — Universal Coefficient Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-tor]]","[[58-df-homology]]","[[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-exact-sequence.md]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-universal-coeff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-universal-coeff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-universal-coeff — Universal Coefficient Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"626a376aca69b0c2\" href=\"?note=626a376aca69b0c2\" title=\"58-df-tor\">58-df-tor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9f6d19a1e737076\" href=\"?note=d9f6d19a1e737076\" title=\"58-df-homology\">58-df-homology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md\">../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fc4e59ceee1c854e\" href=\"?note=fc4e59ceee1c854e\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-exact-sequence.md\">../batch13/58-df-exact-sequence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,G,+_G,n,T\">\\(X,\\tau,G,+_G,n,T\\)</span> (topological space, structured abelian coefficient group, degree <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>, and Tor carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)\\)</span> (structured abelian-group predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md\">../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S((A_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z},(d_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z})\">\\(\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S((A_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z},(d_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z})\\)</span> (exact-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fc4e59ceee1c854e\" href=\"?note=fc4e59ceee1c854e\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-exact-sequence.md\">../batch13/58-df-exact-sequence.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_q^{\\mathrm{sing}}(X;G)\">\\(H_q^{\\mathrm{sing}}(X;G)\\)</span> (metatheoretic singular-homology carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S\\)</span> (Tor-carrier predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"626a376aca69b0c2\" href=\"?note=626a376aca69b0c2\" title=\"58-df-tor\">58-df-tor</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal\\text{-}coeff} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists T,(A_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z},(d_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S(T,\\mathbb Z,H_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{sing}}(X;\\mathbb Z),G,1)\\land\nA_3=0\\land A_2=H_n^{\\mathrm{sing}}(X;\\mathbb Z)\\otimes_{\\mathbb Z}G\\land\nA_1=H_n^{\\mathrm{sing}}(X;G)\\land A_0=T\\land A_{-1}=0\\land\n\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S((A_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z},(d_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z})\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal\\text{-}coeff} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists T,(A_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z},(d_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S(T,\\mathbb Z,H_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{sing}}(X;\\mathbb Z),G,1)\\land\nA_3=0\\land A_2=H_n^{\\mathrm{sing}}(X;\\mathbb Z)\\otimes_{\\mathbb Z}G\\land\nA_1=H_n^{\\mathrm{sing}}(X;G)\\land A_0=T\\land A_{-1}=0\\land\n\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S((A_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z},(d_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z})\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>UCT relates homology with arbitrary coefficients to integer homology.</li>\n<li>The theorem is stated for a genuine topological space and an explicit abelian-group operation; the old antecedent allowed an arbitrary set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> and used unconstructed homology terms as though they were object-level functions.</li>\n<li>Singular chains and the natural comparison maps are outside the current chain-complex atom, so the UCT turnstile records that metatheoretic layer explicitly.</li>\n<li>The sequence is natural in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> and splits as a sequence of abelian groups, but no natural splitting exists in general.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-tor","status":"resolved","id":"626a376aca69b0c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homology","status":"resolved","id":"d9f6d19a1e737076","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homology]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-exact-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"fc4e59ceee1c854e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-exact-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)$ (structured abelian-group predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-exact-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"fc4e59ceee1c854e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S((A_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z},(d_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z})$ (exact-sequence predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-exact-sequence.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tor","status":"resolved","id":"626a376aca69b0c2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S$ (Tor-carrier predicate, see [[58-df-tor]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,G,+_G,n,T","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S((A_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z},(d_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z})","display":false},{"tex":"H_q^{\\mathrm{sing}}(X;G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal\\text{-}coeff} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists T,(A_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z},(d_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S(T,\\mathbb Z,H_{n-1}^{\\mathrm{sing}}(X;\\mathbb Z),G,1)\\land\nA_3=0\\land A_2=H_n^{\\mathrm{sing}}(X;\\mathbb Z)\\otimes_{\\mathbb Z}G\\land\nA_1=H_n^{\\mathrm{sing}}(X;G)\\land A_0=T\\land A_{-1}=0\\land\n\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S((A_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z},(d_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z})\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":2192,"backlinks":[{"id":"03f2d34d9851bee4","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"The universal-coefficient statement is kept in [[58-thm-universal-coeff]], where its maps and exactness belong."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4474","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-thm-universal-coeff.md|58-thm-universal-coeff]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["626a376aca69b0c2","d9f6d19a1e737076","9f54a13cf4872f4e","fc4e59ceee1c854e","815e63e5071e7b58"]}